{"c":[{"name":"20261004T171834Z-0d54f9ef314f8bad","text":"B23: recovery.sqlite holds sealed rows of runs under way (skill_id in clear). At start each row's skill goes back on Tab; readable rows list as 'Stopped when Caret restarted, at step N of M' with undo. Id generators skip ids in use (idTaken).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T181245Z-06db563b8bbd4ad9","text":"W2: react-select makes its input opacity 0 whenever a value is chosen, so the walker's opacity rule dropped it; walker.visibleReactSelect waives only opacity inside a visible react-select box.","type":"note"}]}
